[ti:Written in the Sky]
[ar:Artlyrics Demo]
[00:00.80]Look up, the sky is singing now
[00:04.60]Every word a lantern in the clouds
[00:08.60]Block by block we're painting light
[00:12.40]Watch the letters float into the night
[00:16.60]Sunset gold and lavender
[00:20.20]Every color that you'd ever prefer
[00:24.00]Hold the moment, let it stay
[00:27.60]Written in the sky, then drift away
